/// gh-1026: `scripts/gate_failed_targets.py` — the failed-file extractor
/// behind the gate's `FA_GATE_PTY_RETRIES` rerun-only-failed flake budget.
///
/// The script consumes dart test `--file-reporter=json:<log>` output (the
